    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back to Zero</strong> is a challenging pixel-art platformer in the spirit of \u201cFoddian\u201d classics where every jump counts, and one mistake can send you plummeting all the way back to the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken deep in a mysterious underground cave with one goal: <strong>escape</strong>. There are <strong>no checkpoints</strong> and no mercy. Climb, leap, and fail your way through a vertical gauntlet of punishing terrain and narrow gaps. Every fall is a lesson, and every climb is a triumph.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Precision platforming</strong> with tight, responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Charming pixel art</strong> visuals in a cave world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Fall-to-fail gameplay</strong> with zero checkpoints and infinite retries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Unlockable <strong>power-ups</strong> that shift your movement dynamics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Speedrun-friendly with a timer for players who dare to perfect their climb</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back to Zero</strong> is a challenging pixel-art platformer in the spirit of \u201cFoddian\u201d classics where every jump counts, and one mistake can send you plummeting all the way back to the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken deep in a mysterious underground cave with one goal: <strong>escape</strong>. There are <strong>no checkpoints</strong> and no mercy. Climb, leap, and fail your way through a vertical gauntlet of punishing terrain and narrow gaps. Every fall is a lesson, and every climb is a triumph.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Precision platforming</strong> with tight, responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Charming pixel art</strong> visuals in a cave world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Fall-to-fail gameplay</strong> with zero checkpoints and infinite retries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Unlockable <strong>power-ups</strong> that shift your movement dynamics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Speedrun-friendly with a timer for players who dare to perfect their climb</p></li></ul>",
